	-- vvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvv  START OF YOUR CODE  vvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvv
-- Glue test panel: type a name, press Glue, it stays glued until you press Stop.
-- Survives respawns (yours or the target's), waits if the target leaves and
